meta-carpanel
=============

Project layer for the Car Dashboard infotainment system (Raspberry Pi 4).

Contents
--------

  conf/distro/carpanel.conf        distro policy: poky-based, systemd,
                                   trimmed DISTRO_FEATURES, TARGET_VENDOR
  recipes-core/images/             carpanel-image: the product image
  recipes-kernel/linux/            linux-raspberrypi bbappend: DRM/V3D
                                   drivers forced builtin for full KMS
  recipes-graphics/eglfs-config/   Qt eglfs_kms config pinning the panel
                                   connector, environment for Qt apps
  recipes-qt/carpanel-hello/       minimal QML smoke test
  recipes-qt/qt-instrument-cluster/
                                   the Qt UI, fetched from its own repo
                                   and started by a systemd service

Dependencies
------------

All layers on the scarthgap (5.0 LTS) branch:

  poky (meta, meta-poky)     git://git.yoctoproject.org/poky
  meta-raspberrypi           git://git.yoctoproject.org/meta-raspberrypi
  meta-openembedded          https://github.com/openembedded/meta-openembedded
                             (meta-oe, meta-python — required by meta-qt6)
  meta-qt6                   https://code.qt.io/yocto/meta-qt6.git
                             (pinned at 00c3bd95)

Adding the layer to a build
---------------------------

  bitbake-layers add-layer <path-to-repo>/meta-carpanel

Then set in local.conf:

  MACHINE = "raspberrypi4-64"
  DISTRO  = "carpanel"

and build:

  bitbake carpanel-image

